---
// No imports needed, just HTML/CSS
---

<div class="container mx-auto px-4 relative">
  <div class="text-center">
    <span class="text-xs bg-green-500/10 text-green-500/90 rounded-full px-2 py-1">
      Planes
    </span>
    <h1 class="text-3xl/tight font-medium mb-4">Precios</h1>
    <p class="text-gray-500">
      Planes que se <span class="text-green-500">adaptan</span> a tu negocio
    </p>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-3">
      Timbres, correos, guías y entregas se cobran aparte, solo por lo que uses.
      <a href="/pricing" class="text-green-500 hover:text-green-600">Ver consumibles</a>
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid xl:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-2 grid-cols-1 gap-7 mt-14">
    <div data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="500">
      <div class="transition-all duration-300 pointer-events-auto hover:shadow-[0_0_1.5rem_0_rgba(0,0,0,.12)] hover:-translate-y-1">
        <div class="border border-gray-300 bg-white rounded w-full h-full text-center p-5">
          <span class="text-lg text-green-500">Plan Básico</span>
          <h1 class="text-3xl/tight font-semibold mt-3">
            <sup class="text-gray-500 text-sm font-normal">$</sup> 160
            <sub class="text-gray-500 text-sm font-normal"> MXN/mes</sub>
          </h1>
          <div class="border-b border-gray-200 w-full my-7"></div>
          <div>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 text-sm">
              <p class="flex items-start text-gray-600 gap-3">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-check text-green-500 text-base mt-0.5"></i>
                <span class="text-left">3 cajas</span>
              </p>
              <p class="flex items-start text-gray-600 gap-3">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-check text-green-500 text-base mt-0.5"></i>
                <span class="text-left">25 empleados</span>
              </p>
              <p class="flex items-start text-gray-600 gap-3">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-check text-green-500 text-base mt-0.5"></i>
                <span class="text-left">3,000 productos</span>
              </p>
              <p class="flex items-start text-gray-600 gap-3">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-check text-green-500 text-base mt-0.5"></i>
                <span class="text-left">Facturación</span>
              </p>
              <p class="flex items-start text-gray-600 gap-3">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-check text-green-500 text-base mt-0.5"></i>
                <span class="text-left">Analítica de datos básica</span>
              </p>
              <p class="flex items-start text-gray-600 gap-3">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-check text-green-500 text-base mt-0.5"></i>
                <span class="text-left">Trazabilidad de ventas y compras</span>
              </p>
              <p class="flex items-start text-gray-600 gap-3">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-check text-green-500 text-base mt-0.5"></i>
                <span class="text-left">Módulo de ofertas</span>
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="border-t border-gray-200 w-full my-5"></div>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 text-xs text-gray-500">
              <p class="font-semibold text-gray-700">Extras:</p>
              <p>Caja extra: $30/mes</p>
              <p>Empleado extra: $20/mes</p>
              <p>+2,000 productos: $60/mes</p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex mt-6">
              <a
                href="/product"
                class="bg-green-500/10 text-green-500/90 w-full py-3 rounded-lg border border-transparent hover:border hover:border-green-500/20 transition-all duration-300"
              >
                Comenzar Ahora
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="700">
      <div class="transition-all duration-300 pointer-events-auto hover:shadow-[0_0_1.5rem_0_rgba(0,0,0,.12)] hover:-translate-y-1">
        <div class="border border-gray-300 bg-white rounded w-full h-full text-center p-5">
          <span class="text-lg text-green-500">Plan Emprendedor</span>
          <h1 class="text-3xl/tight font-semibold mt-3">
            <sup class="text-gray-500 text-sm font-normal">$</sup> 290
            <sub class="text-gray-500 text-sm font-normal"> MXN/mes</sub>
          </h1>
          <div class="border-b border-gray-200 w-full my-7"></div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 mb-3">Incluye todo lo del Plan Básico más:</p>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 text-sm">
              <p class="flex items-start text-gray-600 gap-3">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-check text-green-500 text-base mt-0.5"></i>
                <span class="text-left">6 cajas</span>
              </p>
              <p class="flex items-start text-gray-600 gap-3">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-check text-green-500 text-base mt-0.5"></i>
                <span class="text-left">50 empleados</span>
              </p>
              <p class="flex items-start text-gray-600 gap-3">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-check text-green-500 text-base mt-0.5"></i>
                <span class="text-left">6,000 productos</span>
              </p>
              <p class="flex items-start text-gray-600 gap-3">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-check text-green-500 text-base mt-0.5"></i>
                <span class="text-left">Catálogo digital</span>
              </p>
              <p class="flex items-start text-gray-600 gap-3">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-check text-green-500 text-base mt-0.5"></i>
                <span class="text-left">Gestión de ventas y envíos</span>
              </p>
              <p class="flex items-start text-gray-600 gap-3">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-check text-green-500 text-base mt-0.5"></i>
                <span class="text-left">100 mensajes de IA para clientes</span>
              </p>
              <p class="flex items-start text-gray-600 gap-3">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-check text-green-500 text-base mt-0.5"></i>
                <span class="text-left">3 análisis mensuales de datos</span>
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="border-t border-gray-200 w-full my-5"></div>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 text-xs text-gray-500">
              <p class="font-semibold text-gray-700">Extras:</p>
              <p>Caja extra: $20/mes</p>
              <p>+2,000 productos: $40/mes</p>
              <p>+200 mensajes de IA: $100/mes</p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex mt-6">
              <a
                href="/product"
                class="bg-green-500 text-white w-full py-3 rounded-lg border border-transparent hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-green-500/30 focus:shadow-none focus:outline focus:outline-green-500/40 hover:border hover:border-green-500 transition-all duration-300"
              >
                Comenzar Ahora
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="900">
      <div class="transition-all duration-300 pointer-events-auto hover:shadow-[0_0_1.5rem_0_rgba(0,0,0,.12)] hover:-translate-y-1">
        <div class="border border-gray-300 bg-white rounded w-full h-full text-center p-5">
          <span class="text-lg text-green-500">Plan Empresa</span>
          <h1 class="text-3xl/tight font-semibold mt-3">
            <sup class="text-gray-500 text-sm font-normal">$</sup> 500
            <sub class="text-gray-500 text-sm font-normal"> MXN/mes</sub>
          </h1>
          <div class="border-b border-gray-200 w-full my-7"></div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 mb-3">Incluye todo lo del Plan Emprendedor y Básico más:</p>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 text-sm">
              <p class="flex items-start text-gray-600 gap-3">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-check text-green-500 text-base mt-0.5"></i>
                <span class="text-left">12 cajas</span>
              </p>
              <p class="flex items-start text-gray-600 gap-3">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-check text-green-500 text-base mt-0.5"></i>
                <span class="text-left">100 empleados</span>
              </p>
              <p class="flex items-start text-gray-600 gap-3">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-check text-green-500 text-base mt-0.5"></i>
                <span class="text-left">12,000 productos</span>
              </p>
              <p class="flex items-start text-gray-600 gap-3">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-check text-green-500 text-base mt-0.5"></i>
                <span class="text-left">400 mensajes de IA</span>
              </p>
              <p class="flex items-start text-gray-600 gap-3">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-check text-green-500 text-base mt-0.5"></i>
                <span class="text-left">8 análisis mensuales de IA avanzada</span>
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="border-t border-gray-200 w-full my-5"></div>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 text-xs text-gray-500">
              <p class="font-semibold text-gray-700">Extras:</p>
              <p>Sucursal adicional: $300/mes</p>
              <p>Caja extra: $15/mes</p>
              <p>Empleado extra: $10/mes</p>
              <p>+200 mensajes de IA: $50/mes</p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex mt-6">
              <a
                href="/product"
                class="bg-green-500/10 text-green-500/90 w-full py-3 rounded-lg border border-transparent hover:border hover:border-green-500/20 transition-all duration-300"
              >
                Contactar Ventas
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
